@startuml tool5-crash-test
title Tool 5 - Crash-test dummy (chaos harness)

skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

rectangle "CRASH-TEST DUMMY\n--\nbreaks things\non purpose" as H #FFEBEE
rectangle "YOUR AGENT\n--\ntries to finish\nits task anyway" as A #FFCDD2
rectangle "SCORECARD\n--\nDid it recover?\nAny duplicates?\nAny unsafe actions?\nExtra cost?" as S #FFEBEE

H -right-> A : tool timeouts, garbage\nreplies, fake outages,\ntricky instructions
A -right-> S : measured result,\nnot a guess

note bottom of A
  Faults are injected at the bouncer and the
  privacy shield, so ANY agent can be tested
  without changing its code. Runs the same way
  every time, so results are comparable.
end note
@enduml
